  {
    "id": "quick_reference",
    "name": "Quick Reference",
    "type": "non_playable",
    "element": "none",
    "incantation": "",
    "text": "SETUP AND GENERAL RULES\n1. Shuffle the deck.\n2. Each wizard draws 5 cards. If you draw an Event card, discard it and draw a new card.\n3. Each wizard gets 10{life}.\nYou can drink mana potions at any point in the game. Each potion grants 3{mana}.\nDefeat all other wizards to win!\nDURING YOUR TURN\n1. Draw cards up to your hand limit (normally 5). If you draw an Event card, play it immediately and draw a new card.\n2. Perform any number of these actions in any order, each as many times as you want:\n- Play a card.\n- Exchange cards from your hand for new ones from the deck (first one costs 1{mana}, second - 2{mana}, and so on).\n- Discard any number of cards.\n3. Announce your turn's end.",
    "cost": {
      "mana": 0,
      "cards": []
    },
    "target": "none",
    "quantity": 6,
    "pages": [
